1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,100
Anak dah makan,

2
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:03,950
suami dah makan… ibu?

3
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,900
“Nanti la.”

4
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:10,850
Pukul 11 pagi, perut dah mula berbunyi.

5
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,550
Kepala pun rasa berat.

6
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:15,600
Akhirnya, biskut dalam laci juga yang dicapai.

7
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:18,450
Menurut Pinggan Sihat Malaysia,

8
00:00:18,450 --> 00:00:21,700
separuh pinggan kita diisi dengan sayur dan buah.

9
00:00:21,950 --> 00:00:25,500
Suku lagi bijirin dan suku lagi sumber protein.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,700
Sarapan tak perlu mewah.

11
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:29,300
Telur,

12
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,500
overnight oats,

13
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,300
atau siapkan bekal ibu sekali dengan anak.

14
00:00:33,800 --> 00:00:35,800
Kalau betul-betul kelam-kabut,

15
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:39,000
Nutrilite Soy Protein Drink boleh jadi pilihan tambahan.

16
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,300
Bukan pengganti sarapan seimbang.

17
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,800
Perut ibu pun perlu diisi.

18
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,400
Jangan selalu letakkan diri sendiri paling akhir.

